UN(a,b,c){return"Slide "+a+": it merges "+b+" of tiles (+"+c+" points). It's a heuristic, not a proof: it looks a few moves ahead."},
UP(a,b){return"Slide "+a+": nothing to merge for now, but it keeps the board best in order around the biggest tile ("+b+" free cells). It's a heuristic, not a proof: it looks a few moves ahead."},
