ahB(a){return"Mark this cell as not a star: the highlighted "+a+" can only take its stars from this region, using up every one it has left."},
gahz(){return"Mark this cell as not a star: whichever way the grid is finished, no solution ever puts a star here. No simple rule shows it \u2014 this one takes several steps of reasoning."},
ahy(a){return"Mark this cell as not a star: try a star here and keep applying the basic rules \u2014 it cascades into a dead end where the highlighted "+a+" has nowhere left to put its stars."},
ahK(a){return"Mark this cell as not a star: a star here would block so many cells that the highlighted "+a+" would no longer have room for the stars it still needs."},
ahG(a){return"Mark this cell as not a star: it touches every cell where this "+a+" can still place a star, so it would end up next to whichever one gets it."},
